        <item>
            <title>1.1.1</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 19 Jun 2026 00:31:52 +1000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Software updates now stay in front for the whole update, including the final Install and Relaunch window.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Fixed Install and Relaunch getting stuck when the Settings window was open.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Clear now minimises only the windows in the current layout, not every window on the screen.</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/BSKapps/ewp-updates/releases/download/v1.1.1/EWP.1.1.1.zip" length="1621097" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="m1yWl+nFrtECdStPhinW6lQDOrWP7+INCALKmPM62hbx7PogPe+x7ZmSMFd681Mahs22LpcpXBSjGa4J/W3CAg=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.1</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 18 Jun 2026 22:06:54 +1000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
<li>Open saved apps on launch: optionally auto-apply a chosen preset when EWP starts, launching its apps and snapping them into their quadrants</li>
<li>Switching to a preset now launches any of its apps that are not running, then arranges them</li>
<li>Optional per-preset "Quit other apps EWP opened" for a clean switch</li>
<li>Presets locked to a screen fall back to the current screen when that screen is not connected</li>
<li>The window panel now follows monitors being plugged in or unplugged while open</li>
<li>Applying a preset no longer freezes the window while a slow app launches</li>
<li>New Email Support button that copies a diagnostics report and opens an email to support</li>
<li>Deleting a preset that was the startup preset now clears the startup selection</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/BSKapps/ewp-updates/releases/download/v1.1/EWP.1.1.zip" length="1622678" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="AG4g5sZWgLRaAvClrrdFWjy/3PMsKsEXIUP5NbovA8MjseP5G8U5Ik3hVx1GUjjuDPetraZOLEp9b9uNmCWvDw=="/>
        </item>
